OL,3,GNEWSA'I've seen little old ladies run
OL,4,Afrom illegal e-motorbike riders'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRiders on powerful electric motorbikes
OL,7,Fare intimidating pedestrians, damaging
OL,8,Fproperty and putting people at risk by
OL,9,Friding dangerously through towns and
OL,10,Fvillages, communities have warned.
OL,12,FResidents have described riders
OL,13,Fperforming wheelies and riding on
OL,14,Fpavements and footpaths at high speed,
OL,15,Foften while wearing balaclavas.
OL,17,F"I've seen little old ladies have to
OL,18,Frun," said Britt, who fears being hit
OL,19,Fby one. "I've seen little kids being
OL,20,Faimed at."
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
